<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Ceilings - Sp3d up</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Velvet Horizon, Medis Edark</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Ceilings (Sp3d up)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">01CEeW7GisWzTezVd1RMIf</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">1 Contributor</p><p ttm:agent="v1">my ceiling (both balloons) Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She picks me up when I'm down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">These hands that hold up my ceiling</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Crash out when she's not around</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Reflexive, perceiving</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She picks me up when I'm down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">These hands that hold up my ceiling</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Crash out when she ain't around</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Reflexive, perceiving</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I walked in with my head turned down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And eyes wide open but never seeing</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Came back, a familiar sound, in sync but out of reason</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I never knew nothing to do 'cept play guitar and I stand in the watеr</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Promise I'll get back to you, like tidеs rising, I'm in the water</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Time under the factories, learn other words, sing in the weather</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don't sit and be sad for me, need your armor</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I lettered it badly, and I wanna be bad again (Wanna be bad again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She picks me up when I'm down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">These hands that hold up my ceiling</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Crash out when she's not around</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Reflexive, perceiving[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She picks me up when I'm down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">These hands that hold up my ceiling</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Crash out when she ain't around</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Reflexive, perceiving</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She picks me up when I'm down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">These hands that hold up my ceiling</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Crash out when she ain't around</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Reflexive, perceiving</p></div></body></tt>